  "prefLabel": "En 1018.04 Additional Controls",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 1018.04 Additional Controls. A utility shall not be permitted to require an applicant to install, at a cost to the applicant, any additional controls or perform additional tests beyond those included in the interconnection agreement to obtain approval to interconnect. The utility shall be permitted, at a cost to the applicant, to require the installation of controls necessary for safety and reliability that the utility could not have known about at the time the interconnection agreement was executed.\n\nSource. #14657, eff 9-1-26, EXPIRES: 9-1-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/en1000.html"
